      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "34487377"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Interacts with EIF2AK3 (PubMed:26268696). Interacts with ARL6IP1, isoform RTN1-A of RTN1, isoform RTN2-B of RTN2, isoform 3 of RTN3 and isoform 3 of RTN4 (PubMed:25612671). Interacts with RNF5 (PubMed:34487377). Interacts with RNF26 (PubMed:32614325). Interacts with PKD2 (By similarity)"
    }
   ],
